{"ID":"20251114104117-yl0g7tl","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20251114104117-yl0g7tl","title":"UPL9-17——Compute Shader","type":"doc","updated":"20251121115500"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114111303-63746xi","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251114111303-63746xi","updated":"20251114180104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本章代码关键字"}]},{"ID":"20251114111311-66p4myn","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251114111311-66p4myn","updated":"20251114180104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"ComputeShader\t\t\t\t\t// ComputeShader类，可以关联计算Shader资源\ncomputeShader.FindKernel()\t\t// 查找computeShader某个kernel函数的索引，需要传入函数名，通过索引去执行入口函数\ncomputeShader.Dispatch()\t\t// 传入要执行的kernel函数的索引，同时传入xyz线程组，线程组传入数量和kernel函数声明的线程组的线程数量有关\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20251114104117-7t8ydqz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20251114104117-7t8ydqz","name":"ComputeShader","updated":"20251121115500"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Compute Shader"}]},{"ID":"20251114104153-os3z28s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114104153-os3z28s","updated":"20251114105243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Compute Shader (计算着色器) 是让 GPU 帮你算东西的程序，是一种在 GPU 上运行的 通用计算程序\n属于 GPGPU（通用 GPU 计算 —— General-Purpose GPU Computing）的一部分\n它的核心目标是：让开发者脱离渲染管线，直接利用 GPU 的并行计算能力来处理计算任何类型的数据"}]},{"ID":"20251114104153-3tbiben","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114104153-3tbiben","updated":"20251114104227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"举例说明"}]},{"ID":"20251114104227-vhntafd","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251114104227-vhntafd","updated":"20251114104227"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114104227-8qj8mbl","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251114104227-8qj8mbl","updated":"20251114104227"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114104227-em726lf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114104227-em726lf","updated":"20251114104227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CPU 像一个聪明的人，会处理复杂的逻辑（比如“写策划案”）"}]}]},{"ID":"20251114104228-byb0r38","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251114104228-byb0r38","updated":"20251114104228"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114104228-v2qkoqf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114104228-v2qkoqf","updated":"20251114104228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"GPU 像一大群工人，擅长干重复、独立的活（比如“拧螺丝”）"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251114104225-hi0z1ek","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114104225-hi0z1ek","updated":"20251114104244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Compute Shader 就是告诉这群 GPU 工人：\n每个人负责一个任务，大家一起干，干完告诉我结果，比如：\n我们想要计算一个 512 * 512 的图片，每个像素的颜色要变化一点\nCPU 一次只能处理一个像素，要一个一个像素依次处理\nGPU 有几千个核心，可以一次处理几千个像素"}]},{"ID":"20251114104222-g0dgdfl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114104222-g0dgdfl","updated":"20251114104256"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因此，Compute Shader 就相当于是写给 GPU 的批量计算脚本，让 GPU 帮助我们批量的计算"}]},{"ID":"20251114104153-2fu68kt","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20251114104153-2fu68kt","style":"background-color: var(--b3-card-warning-background); color: var(--b3-card-warning-color); --b3-parent-background: var(--b3-card-warning-background);","updated":"20251121115451"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20251114104318-x8fg87x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114104318-x8fg87x","updated":"20251114104318"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意：Compute Shader 不像普通 Shader，它不依赖渲染管线，主要就是用来处理计算的\n普通 Shader 是用来渲染画图的，Compute Shader 是用来计算数据的"}]}]},{"ID":"20251121115452-8ojt2wb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251121115452-8ojt2wb","updated":"20251121115455"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Compute Shader 的应用其实横跨了很多知识体系，比如："}]},{"ID":"20251121115452-tbbus9m","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251121115452-tbbus9m","updated":"20251121115452"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251121115452-6vu67pl","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251121115452-6vu67pl","updated":"20251121115452"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251121115452-j683qup","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251121115452-j683qup","updated":"20251121115452"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图形学知识"}]}]},{"ID":"20251121115452-ype59dl","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251121115452-ype59dl","updated":"20251121115452"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251121115452-pfnqc9j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251121115452-pfnqc9j","updated":"20251121115452"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"并行计算"}]}]},{"ID":"20251121115452-9q3nrw8","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251121115452-9q3nrw8","updated":"20251121115452"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251121115452-77s65sv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251121115452-77s65sv","updated":"20251121115452"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"数学与算法"}]}]},{"ID":"20251121115452-3sam7s2","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20251121115452-3sam7s2","updated":"20251121115452"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251121115452-af1jfbv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251121115452-af1jfbv","updated":"20251121115452"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"引擎整合"}]}]},{"ID":"20251121115452-039mgoq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20251121115452-039mgoq","updated":"20251121115452"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251121115452-kc1gzlp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251121115452-kc1gzlp","updated":"20251121115452"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Shader 开发"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251121115452-eawcru7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251121115452-eawcru7","updated":"20251121115452"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]},{"ID":"20251121115452-fs0550u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251121115452-fs0550u","updated":"20251121115452"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在学习的知识，只是掌握了对 Compute Shader 的基础认知\n知道它的工作原理，知道它的基本使用，具体如何应用它，还有很多路要走"}]},{"ID":"20251121115452-k7u3v6p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251121115452-k7u3v6p","updated":"20251121115500"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你可以认为 Compute Shader 其实并不是 Shader 的补充模块，而是一个独立的并行计算体系！是前端程序员进阶必须要学习的内容！"}]},{"ID":"20251114104324-3rk5jwc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251114104324-3rk5jwc","updated":"20251114110018"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Compute Shader 的基本结构"}]},{"ID":"20251114104345-3c2u2e3","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251114104345-3c2u2e3","updated":"20251114105951"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114104350-bnfi5sv","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251114104350-bnfi5sv","updated":"20251114104350"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114104350-mxal1k0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114104350-mxal1k0","updated":"20251114105356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"创建 Compute Shader 文件"}]},{"ID":"20251114104350-g0go8j9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114104350-g0go8j9","updated":"20251114104525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在 Project 窗口 右键 Create —\u003e Shader —\u003e Compute Shader\n创建的文件后缀为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".compute"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，属于 HLSL 风格代码"}]},{"ID":"20251114104357-r7sskwb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114104357-r7sskwb","updated":"20251114104512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20251114104512-w0ovigu.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]},{"ID":"20251114104350-xfyazln","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251114104350-xfyazln","updated":"20251114105951"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114104350-9qqwxds","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114104350-9qqwxds","updated":"20251114105226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Compute Shader 文件 基本结构"}]},{"ID":"20251114104435-1lclcpy","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251114104435-1lclcpy","updated":"20251114104435"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114104435-xic4g78","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251114104435-xic4g78","updated":"20251114104435"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114104435-0t29a6i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114104435-0t29a6i","updated":"20251114104435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"声明入口函数"}]}]},{"ID":"20251114104435-1pydkpq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251114104435-1pydkpq","updated":"20251114104435"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114104435-t6nl1ym","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114104435-t6nl1ym","updated":"20251114104435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"声明输入输出资源"}]}]},{"ID":"20251114104435-4n7h21p","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251114104435-4n7h21p","updated":"20251114104435"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114104435-t7atu4v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114104435-t7atu4v","updated":"20251114104435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"声明每个线程组内的线程数量"}]}]},{"ID":"20251114104435-caaebq8","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20251114104435-caaebq8","updated":"20251114104435"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114104435-pb93aba","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114104435-pb93aba","updated":"20251114104435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"声明入口函数类型"}]}]},{"ID":"20251114104435-3m8hukz","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20251114104435-3m8hukz","updated":"20251114104435"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114104435-z1p25os","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114104435-z1p25os","updated":"20251114104435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"书写核心计算逻辑"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251114105946-xda994g","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251114105946-xda994g","updated":"20251114105951"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"aGxzbA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"// 1. 声明入口函数\n#pragma kernel CSMain\n\n// 2. 声明输入输出资源\nRWTexture2D\u003cfloat4\u003e Result;\n\n[numthreads(8,8,1)] // 3. 声明每个线程组内线程数量\n// 4. 声明入口函数类型\nvoid CSMain (uint3 id : SV_DispatchThreadID)\n{\n    // 5. 书写核心计算逻辑\n    Result[id.xy] = float4(id.x \u0026 id.y, (id.x \u0026 15)/15.0, (id.y \u0026 15)/15.0, 0.0);\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251114110018-eo9mztw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"alias":"computeShader.Dispatch()","id":"20251114110018-eo9mztw","name":"computeShader.FindKernel()","updated":"20251114113310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"C"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"#"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 调用 Compute Shader"}]},{"ID":"20251114110025-r8offoa","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251114110025-r8offoa","updated":"20251114110912"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114110411-pjheh64","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251114110411-pjheh64","updated":"20251114110719"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114110411-jmvt345","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114110411-jmvt345","updated":"20251114110719"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在 C"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"#"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 代码中找到对应的 ComputeShader 文件，可以声明 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"ComputeShader"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 类型公开变量，然后在 Inspector 处关联对象，或者动态加载"}]}]},{"ID":"20251114110411-ku9fake","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251114110411-ku9fake","updated":"20251114110741"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114110411-b0akq5n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114110411-b0akq5n","updated":"20251114110741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"利用 API 找到入口函数索引 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"computeShader.FindKernel()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]},{"ID":"20251114110411-8hsko69","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251114110411-8hsko69","updated":"20251114110907"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114110411-gmksh39","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114110411-gmksh39","updated":"20251114110907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"传递相关参数 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"computeShader.SetXXX()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​（不同类型参数调用不同的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Set"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 方法）"}]}]},{"ID":"20251114110411-w1l5t5v","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20251114110411-w1l5t5v","updated":"20251114110909"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114110411-q1cu53y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114110411-q1cu53y","updated":"20251114110909"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"启动计算 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"computeShader.Dispatch(入口函数索引, x线程组数, y线程组数, z线程组数)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]},{"ID":"20251114110411-soh1ed3","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20251114110411-soh1ed3","updated":"20251114110912"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114110411-60bjpb7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114110411-60bjpb7","updated":"20251114110912"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用 GPU 计算完成输出的数据渲染或者传回 CPU"}]}]},{"ID":"20251114110411-nl9wfsn","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Ni4=","Num":6},"Properties":{"id":"20251114110411-nl9wfsn","updated":"20251114110411"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114110411-xrpgqmt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114110411-xrpgqmt","updated":"20251114110411"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"释放资源"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251114113306-6d9hytr","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20251114113306-6d9hytr","style":"background-color: var(--b3-card-warning-background); color: var(--b3-card-warning-color); --b3-parent-background: var(--b3-card-warning-background);","updated":"20251114113310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20251114113306-d25z1m4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114113306-d25z1m4","updated":"20251114113310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Dispatch()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 函数的调用类似异步，不会对 CPU 造成阻塞"}]}]},{"ID":"20251114110915-mcx2duz","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251114110915-mcx2duz","updated":"20251114113126"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"using UnityEngine;\n\npublic class Lesson92 : MonoBehaviour\n{\n    public ComputeShader computeShader;     // 声明 computeShader 变量，可以通过 Inspector 窗口关联，也可以动态加载\n\n    void Start()\n    {\n        int index = computeShader.FindKernel(\"CSMain\"); // 获取 computeShader 中名为 CSMain 的函数索引\n        computeShader.SetFloat(\"f\", 10.0f);             // 传递相关参数\n        computeShader.Dispatch(index, 64, 64, 0);       // 启动计算\n        // 使用GPU计算完成输出的数据渲染或者传回CPU\n        // 释放资源\n    }\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20251114111215-k4zioqr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251114111215-k4zioqr","updated":"20251121114429"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Compute Shader 相关"}]},{"ID":"20251114111914-4j4d7nz","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251114111914-4j4d7nz","updated":"20251121114429"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114111938-k7m8z8x","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251114111938-k7m8z8x","updated":"20251114112150"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114111938-mcxq03n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114111938-mcxq03n","updated":"20251114112150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20251114112150-ledl594","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"多个入口函数"}]}]},{"ID":"20251114111944-o3nbcju","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251114111944-o3nbcju","updated":"20251114113958"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251114111944-hfv26bq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251114111944-hfv26bq","updated":"20251114113958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20251114113958-4yusm5s","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"数据类型"}]}]},{"ID":"20251114112113-1wgo64c","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"2025111